  "reason": "A low-glare aubergine-charcoal dark theme with lavender text keeps evening reconciliation calm, while amber is reserved for overdue money so urgent balances stand out without alarming the rest of the screen.",
  "design_html": "<style>\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');\n:root {\n  --background: 37.9 51.4% 92.7%;\n  --foreground: 22.2 29.7% 17.8%;\n  --card: 38.2 57.9% 96.3%;\n  --card-foreground: 22.2 29.7% 17.8%;\n  --popover: 38.2 57.9% 96.3%;\n  --popover-foreground: 22.2 29.7% 17.8%;\n  --primary: 14.1 51.5% 46.9%;\n  --primary-foreground: 0 0% 100%;\n  --secondary: 15.4 63.7% 33.5%;\n  --secondary-foreground: 0 0% 100%;\n  --muted: 210 40% 96.1%;\n  --muted-foreground: 26.3 14.7% 42.7%;\n  --accent: 39.1 66.7% 55.3%;\n  --accent-foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n  --destructive: 358.1 62.3% 40.6%;\n  --destructive-foreground: 0 0% 100%;\n  --border: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n  --input: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n  --ring: 14.1 51.5% 46.9%;\n  --radius: 0.5rem;\n  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px 0 hsl(var(--foreground) / 0.06);\n  --shadow: 0 4px 12px -2px hsl(var(--foreground) / 0.10);\n  --shadow-lg: 0 12px 32px -8px hsl(var(--foreground) / 0.14);\n}\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:hsl(var(--background));color:hsl(var(--foreground));font-family:'Inter',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;}\n</style>\n<div class=\"pd\"> <style>.pd{background:hsl(var(--background));color:hsl(var(--foreground));min-height:100%;line-height:1.55;font-size:1rem}.pd *{box-sizing:border-box}.pd .wrap{max-width:72rem;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem}.pd .card{background:hsl(var(--card));color:hsl(var(--card-foreground));border:1px solid hsl(var(--border));border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);padding:1.5rem}.pd .nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5;background:hsl(var(--card));border-bottom:1px solid hsl(var(--border))}.pd .nav-in{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1.5rem;height:4.25rem}.pd .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem}.pd .logo{height:2.25rem;width:2.25rem;object-fit:contain;border-radius:9999px}.pd .word{font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em}.pd .links{display:flex;gap:.25rem}.pd .links a{padding:.5rem .9rem;border-radius:9999px;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:500;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));text-decoration:none}.pd .links a.on{background:hsl(var(--primary) / 0.1);color:hsl(var(--primary));font-weight:600}.pd .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.45rem;height:2.75rem;padding:0 1.4rem;border-radius:9999px;font-size:.95rem;font-weight:600;border:1px solid transparent;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.pd .btn-primary{background:hsl(var(--primary));color:hsl(var(--primary-foreground));box-shadow:var(--shadow)}.pd .btn-outline{background:transparent;border-color:hsl(var(--border));color:hsl(var(--foreground))}.pd .btn-sm{height:2.25rem;padding:0 1rem;font-size:.85rem}.pd .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:3rem;align-items:center;padding-top:4rem;padding-bottom:3.5rem}.pd .badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;padding:.3rem .85rem;border-radius:9999px;background:hsl(var(--secondary));color:hsl(var(--secondary-foreground));font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600}.pd h1{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5vw,3.6rem);line-height:1.05;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:1.25rem 0 1rem}.pd .lead{font-size:1.15rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));max-width:34rem;margin:0 0 2rem}.pd .cta{display:flex;gap:.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap}.pd .fine{font-size:.82rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));margin:1.25rem 0 0}.pd .glance{position:relative}.pd .glance-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:1rem}.pd .label{font-size:.8rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));font-weight:500;margin:0}.pd .big{font-size:2.25rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:.2rem 0 1rem}.pd .bar{height:.75rem;border-radius:9999px;background:hsl(var(--muted));overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:.5rem}.pd .bar i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:9999px;background:hsl(var(--primary))}.pd .split{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.8rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));margin-bottom:1.25rem}.pd .mini{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:.75rem 0;border-top:1px solid hsl(var(--border));font-size:.9rem}.pd .sticker{position:absolute;top:-1rem;right:-.75rem;transform:rotate(6deg);background:hsl(var(--accent));color:hsl(var(--accent-foreground));border-radius:9999px;padding:.35rem .9rem;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}.pd .ico{width:2.75rem;height:2.75rem;border-radius:var(--radius);background:hsl(var(--primary) / 0.1);color:hsl(var(--primary));display:grid;place-items:center;margin-bottom:1rem}.pd .ico svg{width:1.3rem;height:1.3rem}.pd .sec{padding:3.5rem 0}.pd .sec-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem;flex-wrap:wrap}.pd h2{font-size:1.9rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 .4rem;line-height:1.15}.pd .sub{color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));margin:0;max-width:34rem}.pd .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.25rem}.pd h3{font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 .4rem}.pd .grid p{margin:0;font-size:.92rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground))}.pd .coll{padding:0;overflow:hidden}.pd .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr .9fr .9fr 1.1fr;gap:1rem;align-items:center;padding:1rem 1.5rem;border-top:1px solid hsl(var(--border));font-size:.92rem}.pd .row.head{border-top:0;background:hsl(var(--muted) / 0.5);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em}.pd .tag{display:inline-flex;padding:.2rem .65rem;border-radius:9999px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;background:hsl(var(--destructive) / 0.12);color:hsl(var(--destructive));width:fit-content}.pd .tag.soft{background:hsl(var(--secondary));color:hsl(var(--secondary-foreground))}.pd .muted{color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground))}.pd .toolbar{display:flex;gap:.6rem;align-items:center;padding:1rem 1.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid hsl(var(--border))}.pd .input{flex:1;height:2.5rem;border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid hsl(var(--border));background:hsl(var(--background));padding:0 1rem;font-size:.9rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));display:flex;align-items:center}.pd code{font-size:.82rem;background:hsl(var(--muted));padding:.15rem .45rem;border-radius:calc(var(--radius) - 4px)}.pd .cta-band{margin:1rem 0 3.5rem;border-radius:var(--radius);background:hsl(var(--primary));color:hsl(var(--primary-foreground));padding:2.5rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1.5rem;box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg)}.pd .cta-band h2{color:hsl(var(--primary-foreground));margin:0 0 .3rem}.pd .cta-band p{margin:0;opacity:.9}.pd .btn-light{background:hsl(var(--background));color:hsl(var(--foreground));box-shadow:var(--shadow)}.pd .foot{border-top:1px solid hsl(var(--border));background:hsl(var(--card));padding:2rem 0}.pd .foot-in{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.88rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground))}.pd .foot-links{display:flex;gap:1.25rem}@media (max-width:900px){.pd .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pd .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.pd .links{display:none}.pd .row{grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr}.pd .row .hide-m{display:none}}@media (max-width:600px){.pd .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style> <header class=\"nav\"> <div class=\"wrap nav-in\"> <div class=\"brand\"><img data-nexen-logo src=\"\" alt=\"PocketDash logo\" class=\"logo\"><span class=\"word\">PocketDash</span></div> <nav class=\"links\"><a class=\"on\" href=\"#\">Invoices</a><a href=\"#\">Collections</a><a href=\"#\">Cash forecast</a><a href=\"#\">Bills</a><a href=\"#\">Settings</a></nav> <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\">New invoice</button> </div> </header> <main> <section class=\"wrap hero\"> <div> <span class=\"badge\">Made for student shops</span> <h1>Get paid for every tee and crochet gift.</h1> <p class=\"lead\">PocketDash keeps unpaid invoices, friendly follow-ups and your cash forecast in one place, so you always know what has actually landed.</p> <div class=\"cta\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">Create your first invoice</button><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">See who owes you</button></div> <p class=\"fine\">Reminders are drafts you review and send yourself.</p> </div> <div class=\"card glance\"> <span class=\"sticker\">3 chasers today</span> <div class=\"glance-top\"><p class=\"label\">Outstanding balance</p><span class=\"tag soft\">30-day view</span></div> <p class=\"big\">$412.50</p> <div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:68%\"></i></div> <div class=\"split\"><span>$281.00 collected</span><span>68% paid</span></div> <div class=\"mini\"><span>INV-<code>0042</code> · Maya T.</span><span class=\"tag\">4 days overdue</span></div> <div class=\"mini\"><span>INV-<code>0045</code> · Jonah K.</span><span class=\"tag soft\">Due Fri</span></div> </div> </section> <section class=\"wrap sec\"> <div class=\"sec-head\"><div><h2>Everything from order to payment</h2><p class=\"sub\">Itemised invoices, recorded payments and a cash view that stays honest.</p></div><button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\">Explore features</button></div> <div class=\"grid\"> <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 3h9l4 4v14H6z\"/><path d=\"M9 13h6M9 17h4\"/></svg></div><h3>Itemised invoices</h3><p>Add printed tees, crochet gifts and delivery charges, then preview or save as PDF.</p></div> <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M4 21c1-4 4-6 8-6s7 2 8 6\"/></svg></div><h3>Reusable customers</h3><p>Save names, phones and emails once and reuse saved item details on every order.</p></div> <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"6\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"M3 10h18\"/></svg></div><h3>Payments, clearly logged</h3><p>Record advances and partial payments. Manual entries are labelled seller-recorded.</p></div> <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M4 19V5M4 19h16\"/><path d=\"M8 15l4-5 3 3 5-6\"/></svg></div><h3>30, 60, 90-day forecast</h3><p>See projected cash with a first shortage date, and test a delayed collection safely.</p></div> <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"/></svg></div><h3>Bills on the radar</h3><p>Add upcoming bills by category and flag overdue ones before they hit your cash.</p></div> <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M4 6l8 6 8-6M4 6v12h16V6\"/></svg></div><h3>Reminder drafts</h3><p>Editable messages built from real invoice details, ready to copy or open in WhatsApp.</p></div> </div> </section> <section class=\"wrap sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"> <div class=\"sec-head\"><div><h2>Collections, sorted by priority</h2><p class=\"sub\">Overdue balances rise to the top by amount and days late.</p></div><div class=\"input\" style=\"max-width:16rem\">Search customers</div></div> <div class=\"card coll\"> <div class=\"toolbar\"><span class=\"tag soft\">Overdue · 2</span><span class=\"tag soft\">Not yet due · 1</span></div> <div class=\"row head\"><span>Customer</span><span>Invoice</span><span>Outstanding</span><span class=\"hide-m\">Due</span><span>Days overdue</span><span class=\"hide-m\">Last follow-up</span></div> <div class=\"row\"><span>Maya Tran</span><span><code>INV-0042</code></span><span>$96.00</span><span class=\"hide-m muted\">12 Mar</span><span><span class=\"tag\">4 days</span></span><span class=\"hide-m muted\">Reminder sent 13 Mar</span></div> <div class=\"row\"><span>Eli Okafor</span><span><code>INV-0039</code></span><span>$140.00</span><span class=\"hide-m muted\">08 Mar</span><span><span class=\"tag\">8 days</span></span><span class=\"hide-m muted\">Never</span></div> <div class=\"row\"><span>Jonah Keller</span><span><code>INV-0045</code></span><span>$64.50</span><span class=\"hide-m muted\">21 Mar</span><span class=\"muted\">Not due</span><span class=\"hide-m muted\">Not needed</span></div> </div> </section> <section class=\"wrap\"> <div class=\"cta-band\"> <div><h2>Ready for your next drop?</h2><p>Set your opening cash balance once and PocketDash keeps the numbers current.</p></div> <button class=\"btn btn-light\">Start with PocketDash</button> </div> </section> </main> <footer class=\"foot\"> <div class=\"wrap foot-in\"> <div class=\"brand\"><img data-nexen-logo src=\"\" alt=\"PocketDash logo\" class=\"logo\" style=\"height:1.75rem;width:1.75rem\"><span class=\"word\" style=\"font-size:1rem\">PocketDash</span></div> <span>Estimates only. Collections are not bank-verified.</span> <div class=\"foot-links\"><a href=\"#\">Help</a><a href=\"#\">Privacy</a><a href=\"#\">Settings</a></div> </div> </footer> </div>",
